5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Let's make sure we pick something that keeps us all friends. I'll check the station block's meeting minutes and the residents' meeting statements.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"That is a lovely thought, Kenji. I would like to see the supervised mornings on the next lane and the station block's bin house.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need concrete data on the effort involved. I will look into the supervised mornings on the next lane and the ward filing requirements.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know if it's fair for everyone! I'll check the measurements of the five frontages and the ward complaint log.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
