30,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"It seems people struggle to be strict with each other. Even in other blocks, small things like a broken latch cause big fights.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I've learned that some ""solutions"" can actually make the smell worse in the summer. We must be very careful about what we build.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The paperwork for a permanent build is extensive, and the time commitment for supervision is about twenty mornings a year per house.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Rin,,"It's not fair! One house has complained way more than others because it's always at their gate, and some frontages are too narrow.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Servas,,"We must consider the gold. A shelter is expensive, though there is a subsidy, and we already spend quite a bit on maintenance.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, if the space is the problem, maybe we shouldn't keep it in one spot?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, twenty mornings a year sounds like a lot of work for some of us.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, it is. And the ward requires a new notice every single time the site changes, which is a logical nightmare.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji, yes! Moving it would mean everyone takes a turn having it at their gate.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, a rotating system avoids the cost of a building, which would be a heavy burden on some budgets.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I just don't want us arguing over who didn't sweep the bin house or who forgot to move the bags.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"A rotating spot might be stressful if we aren't organized, but a smelly box is worse.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"If we rotate, the administrative burden of filing notices with the ward for every move is a significant deterrent.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Rin,,But is it better to make one person suffer for years? The complaint log shows that's happening now.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Patience, everyone. We must weigh the cost of money against the cost of effort and the cost of harmony.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
