55,3,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm worried about Option A and C because they seem to lead to more arguments over chores and rules.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Option A sounds like it could be a smelly mistake, and Option C seems too demanding for our mornings.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A is a bureaucratic hurdle and Option C requires too much unpaid labor. Option B is the most logical.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option B is the only one that is actually fair to the person whose gate it's currently at!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Servas,,Option B is the most economical. It spares us the high cost of construction and the risk of a permanent eyesore.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, if you think B is logical, I'm inclined to agree, as long as we stay friendly.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree. Let's avoid the smell of a bin house and the stress of strict hours.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"The filing for B is tedious, but it is preferable to the long-term maintenance conflicts of A.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Rin,,I'm voting for B! It's the only way to make it equal for all five houses.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Servas,,It seems we have found a path that respects both the pocketbook and the spirit of the neighborhood.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm set on B.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I am as well.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Asuka,,B is my choice.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Rin,,Definitely B!,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Servas,,I concur. B it is.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
